               Summary: Recent advances and breakthroughs related to {{query}} 
               from the past year.
            3. {{query}}: Expert Analysis - Research Journal
               Summary: In-depth expert analysis covering implications, challenges, 
               and future directions of {{query}}.
            """;
    }

